    "GUIDED_RUN_PREFETCH_FOOTER" : [
      {
        "target" : "Gli allenamenti vengono scaricati quando Apple Watch è collegato all'alimentazione. Una volta completati, vengono eliminati.",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "it"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Latihan dimuat turun apabila Apple Watch disambungkan ke sumber kuasa dan dipadamkan setelah anda melengkapkannya.",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "ms"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Los entrenos se descargan al conectar el Apple Watch a la corriente y se eliminan a medida que los vas completando.",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "es"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Os treinos são descarregados quando o Apple Watch está ligado à corrente e são apagados depois de concluídos.",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "pt_PT"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Träningar hämtas när Apple Watch är ansluten till en strömkälla och raderas när du har slutfört dem.",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "sv"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Os exercícios serão baixados quando o Apple Watch estiver conectado à alimentação e serão apagados quando você completá-los.",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "pt_BR"
      },
      {
        "target" : "ワークアウトは、Apple Watchが充電器にセットされているときにダウンロードされ、ワークアウトが完了すると削除されます。",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "ja"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Az edzések akkor lesznek letöltve, amikor az Apple Watch töltőhöz csatlakozik, és törölve lesznek, ha elvégezte őket.",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "hu"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Els entrenaments es descarreguen en connectar l’Apple Watch al corrent i s’eliminen un cop completats.",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "ca"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Тренировките се изтеглят, когато Apple Watch е свързан към захранване, и се изтриват, когато приключите с тях.",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "bg"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Treenit latautuvat, kun Apple Watch on liitetty virtalähteeseen, ja ne poistetaan, kun olet suorittanut ne.",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "fi"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Apple Watch接入电源时会下载体能训练，并在训练完成后删除。",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "zh_CN"
      },
      {
        "target" : "การออกกำลังกายจะดาวน์โหลดเมื่อ Apple Watch วางอยู่บนที่ชาร์จและถูกลบเมื่อคุณออกกำลังกายเสร็จ",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "th"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Trainings werden geladen, wenn die Apple Watch ans Stromnetz angeschlossen ist, und gelöscht, sobald du sie abgeschlossen hast.",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "de"
      },
      {
        "target" : "يتم تنزيل التمارين عندما تكون Apple Watch متصلة بمصدر طاقة، وتُحذف بعد إكمالها.",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "ar"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Тренировки загружаются, когда часы Apple Watch подключены к источнику питания, и удаляются после завершения.",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "ru"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Πραγματοποιείται λήψη προπονήσεων, όταν το Apple Watch είναι συνδεδεμένο στο ρεύμα, και διαγράφονται όταν τις ολοκληρώσετε.",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "el"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Olahraga diunduh saat Apple Watch tersambung ke daya dan dihapus setelah Anda selesai.",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "id"
      },
      {
        "target" : "वर्कआउट तब डाउनलोड किए जाते हैं जब Apple Watch पावर से कनेक्टेड हो और जब आप उन्हें कर लेते हैं, तो उन्हें डिलीट कर दिया जाता है।",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "hi"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Træninger hentes, når Apple Watch er sluttet til strøm, og slettes igen, når du har gennemført dem.",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "da"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Тренування викачуються, коли Apple Watch підʼєднано до джерела живлення. Завершені тренування видаляються.",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "uk"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Les exercices sont téléchargés lorsque l’Apple Watch est en charge et sont supprimés une fois terminés.",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "fr"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Los entrenamientos se descargan cuando el Apple Watch está conectado a la corriente y se eliminan cuando los hayas terminado.",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "es_419"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Exercițiile sunt descărcate atunci când Apple Watch‑ul este conectat la alimentare și sunt șterse după ce le finalizați.",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "ro"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Work-outs worden gedown­load wanneer de Apple Watch op het licht­net is aangesloten, en verwijderd zodra je ze hebt voltooid.",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "nl"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Antrenmanlar, Apple Watch güç kaynağına bağlıyken indirilir ve onları tamamladığınızda silinir.",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "tr"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Workouts download when Apple Watch is connected to power and are deleted once you’ve completed them.",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "en_GB"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Жаттығулар Apple Watch сағаты қуат көзіне қосылған кезде жүктеп алынады және оларды орындағаннан кейін жойылады.",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "kk"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Các bài tập được tải về khi Apple Watch được kết nối vào nguồn điện và được xóa sau khi bạn đã hoàn tất.",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "vi"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Les entraînements sont téléchargés lorsque l’Apple Watch est branchée sur une source d’alimentation et sont supprimés dès que vous les terminez.",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "fr_CA"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Apple Watch가 전원에 연결되어 있을 때 운동이 다운로드되며, 완료한 운동은 삭제됩니다.",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "ko"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Workouts download when Apple Watch is connected to power and are deleted once you’ve done them.",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "en_AU"
      },
      {
        "target" : "當Apple Watch連接電源時，會下載體能訓練。你完成該體能訓練後，會刪除有關內容。",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "zh_HK"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Tréningy sa sťahujú, keď sú Apple Watch pripojené k napájaniu, a keď ich dokončíte, budú vymazané.",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "sk"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Treningi są pobierane, gdy Apple Watch jest podłączony do zasilania, i usuwane po ich ukończeniu.",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "pl"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Cvičení se do Apple Watch stahují, když jsou hodinky připojené k napájení, a po odcvičení se automaticky mažou.",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "cs"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Treningsøktene lastes ned når Apple Watch er koblet til strøm, og de blir slettet etter at du har fullført dem.",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "no"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Treninzi se preuzimaju kad je Apple Watch spojen na napajanje te se brišu nakon što ih dovršite.",
        "filename" : "SessionTrackerAppSettings-breeze.loctable",
        "language" : "hr"
